WEBVTT

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:26.210
ashita he tsuzuku sakamichi no tochuu de

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:26.210
On the uphill road that leads to tomorrow

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:32.510
surechigau otona tachi wa tsubuyaku no sa

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:32.510
We pass by adults who tell us this

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.640
"ai toka yume toka risou mo wakaru kedo

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.640
"I can understand ideals such as love and dreams

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:43.810
me no mae no genjitsu wa sonna ni amaku nai" tte

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:43.810
but the real world isn't as easy as you think"

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:50.150
tsumazuki nagara mo korogari nagara mo

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:50.150
Even though we keep tripping and falling

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:55.360
kasabuta darake no jyounetsu wo wasuretaku nai

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:55.360
We have to remember these pains of growing up

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:58.830
otona ni narenai bokura no

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:58.830
For all of us who can't force ourselves to do so yet

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.330
tsuyogari wo hitotsu kiite kure

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.330
Listen to this one thing I have to say

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:04.540
nige mo kakure mo shinai kara

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:04.540
I won't run or cower away

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:07.460
waraitai yatsu dake warae

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:07.460
So whoever wants to laugh at me, go ahead

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:10.250
semete tayori nai bokura no

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:10.250
Since we can't be relied upon yet

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:12.800
jiyuu no me wo tsumitoranai de

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:12.800
Don't take away our seed of freedom

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:15.800
mizu wo ageru sono yakume wo

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:15.800
The task of nurturing this plant

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:18.890
hataseba iindarou?

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:18.890
That's all we have to do, right?

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:30.020
{Intro}

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:34.900
Bank

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:51.840
What's wrong?

00:01:53.090 --> 00:01:54.670
Where are your mom and dad?

00:01:59.510 --> 00:01:59.550
{Part A}

00:02:03.350 --> 00:02:08.020
The Kind Demon, Koruru

00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:10.060
I'm home!

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:13.480
Well then, how about a bath?

00:02:15.610 --> 00:02:18.150
Whoa! How long are you going
to cling to me like that?

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:20.030
I'm not going to run away or anything.

00:02:21.870 --> 00:02:23.120
There! Good girl.

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:24.370
What's your name?

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:27.250
Koruru.

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:28.500
Koruru-chan?

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:30.880
I'm Shiori. Nice to meet you!

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:33.500
I'll be right back, so just wait here, okay?

00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:36.550
My old clothes should be
around here somewhere...

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:44.470
Microwave this

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:49.560
This month's cram-school tuition and
money for lunch are inside.
I have to prepare for the exhibition,
so please look after the house again.

00:02:52.980 --> 00:02:54.110
The bath is hot!

00:02:52.980 --> 00:02:58.280
{}In Japan, the bathtub isn't usually filled with
hot water. It gets filled, and then heated.

00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:55.860
This way!

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:03.030
They're a perfect fit!

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:07.330
I wore them when I was little.
It's a good thing we kept them!

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:09.910
Umm... and my clothes...

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:12.960
I'll give them back once
they've been properly washed.

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:15.920
I'll also clean up your backpack, okay?

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:20.090
You're so nice, Shiori-chan!

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:22.640
That's not all!
Now, let's eat dinner!

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:26.350
Does it taste good?

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:29.850
Don't be shy, keep eating!

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:33.150
By the way, where are your parents?

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:36.780
You looked like you were going
to catch a cold, so I took you with me.

00:03:36.780 --> 00:03:39.280
What if they're looking for you?

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:40.490
I don't have any.

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:44.370
"Don't have any?"
You can't mean that, right?

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:47.160
Do you know your address?
What about your phone number?

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:50.040
I'm sorry. I really am alone.

00:03:50.210 --> 00:03:55.500
So, no matter where I go, I'll be alone.

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:07.430
Here, eat this.

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:10.730
Thank you, Shiori-chan!

00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:12.230
Call me "Sis"!

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:17.150
Sis! Sis Shiori!

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:19.030
That's good!

00:04:19.030 --> 00:04:21.360
When you're done eating,
let's go play in my room!

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:22.360
Okay!

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:34.460
Hey, Gash!

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:37.170
{}Words on bumper: Je t'aime!
Baiser! = I love you! Smooch!

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:40.340
We found a new place to hang out,
so we won't come here anymore.

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:42.880
Naomi-chan, where's this new place?

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:46.180
I'm not telling you.

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:55.770
Will you play with me?

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:16.500
I'm begging you! Please take me
to school with you, Kiyomaro!

00:05:16.880 --> 00:05:19.630
I hate playing by myself,
Kiyomaro!

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:21.800
Why is he so desperate today?

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:24.670
Gash, did you forget about him?

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:27.010
Your number one friend?

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:37.350
That's right!
There's Vulcan! Vulcan!

00:05:37.350 --> 00:05:40.570
Yay! Vulcan!
Let's go to the park!

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:51.450
My sister will be here soon!

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:02.340
Here you go, Tina-chan!
 A crown of flowers!

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:04.590
It makes you really pretty, right?

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:06.300
Oh, there's somebody here already?

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:09.680
Gash!

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:12.310
This is the first time
I've seen you around here.

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:13.310
What's your name?

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:16.020
He doesn't remember me?

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:18.190
My name is Gash Bell!

00:06:20.610 --> 00:06:22.070
I'm Koruru!

00:06:22.070 --> 00:06:23.860
I just moved here.

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:25.070
Is that so?

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:28.360
This is my friend, Vulcan 300.

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:29.990
"Nice to meet you!"

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:33.240
This is my friend, Tina.

00:06:33.530 --> 00:06:34.830
"Nice to meet you!"

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:44.420
I bet you got that at a store, didn't you?

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:46.340
Really, buying your friends with money...

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:50.130
Nope. It's handmade by my sister, Shiori!

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:54.260
"This way, you won't be lonely
while I'm at school," she said.

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:57.060
She probably spent many days making it.

00:06:57.600 --> 00:07:00.600
Kiyomaro! Thank you! How old is Vulcan?

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:01.810
Five minutes!

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:04.860
Her clothes are the same as Shiori's!

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:08.110
He was made from a snack box
and disposable chopsticks!

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:12.870
M-My Vulcan...

00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:17.660
He's not even glued together...

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:19.620
Koruru! Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:21.580
Sis Shiori!

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:23.630
Well then, want to go home?

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:25.250
A friend of yours?

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:27.590
Y-Yeah. We just met.

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:30.800
Oh, yeah. I made this!

00:07:32.090 --> 00:07:33.510
It matches Tina's!

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:39.140
This is my way of saying thank you
for Tina! It looks good on you!

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:43.100
All right! Hop on my back!

00:07:43.100 --> 00:07:44.190
Is it okay?

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:46.730
Homeward bound!

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:50.110
Hold on tight! This is the train home!

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:54.620
We've arrived!

00:07:57.330 --> 00:07:58.910
Now, let's eat dinner!

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:03.420
Until next month,
because of work,
I'm completely busy.
If you need anything,
leave a note.

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:08.090
Shiori's Room

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:12.760
You're pretty tired, aren't you?

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:15.930
Things used to be different.

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:17.720
It's more like a family now!

00:08:17.720 --> 00:08:21.560
I'm busy. I don't have time to listen
to your stories about school.

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:25.310
When they schedule your parent-teacher meeting, leave me a note. I'll make time.

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:26.310
No.

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:28.900
That's not a family.

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:35.990
Koruru is my only family.

00:08:36.990 --> 00:08:41.580
If she really doesn't have anyone
in this world, I'll take care of her.

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:44.830
I'll always stay with her.
 I'll always protect her.

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:49.250
What? Koruru's bag is glowing.

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:53.590
A pink book?

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:56.090
Why is it here?

00:08:57.300 --> 00:08:58.930
My hands are moving on their own.

00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:01.390
Mysterious letters...

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:05.440
Huh? This is the only page
with lines I can read.

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:07.360
Zeru...

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:08.900
Don't!

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:11.860
Don't read from the book!

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:28.380
Koruru!

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:29.880
What happened?

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:32.800
What happened to Koruru?

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:45.020
Who are you?

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:47.350
You don't know me? I'm Shiori.

00:09:47.350 --> 00:09:49.060
Then you're the book's owner?

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:51.860
Owner? Are you really Koruru?

00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:53.780
Yes... I'm Koruru.

00:09:54.490 --> 00:09:56.150
I am Koruru.

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:59.450
Now, hurry and read the spell!

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:01.530
What are you saying?

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:03.620
I want to wreak more havoc!

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:07.370
Read from the book,
and release my power!

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:09.080
Stop!

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:12.130
Return to normal!
Go back to being the nice Koruru!

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:16.920
Quickly! Read the spell!

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:19.390
She's shrinking and slowing down.

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:22.180
Why won't you read the spell?

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:25.770
I get it! If I don't do
anything for the demon...

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:29.190
What? You don't want to fight?

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:33.320
It's useless to resist.
It's destiny.

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:34.480
Koruru!

00:10:36.070 --> 00:10:38.570
You can't escape.

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:48.830
Kiyomaro, I'm begging you!
 Please remake Vulcan!

00:10:48.830 --> 00:10:51.920
Use tape, glue, or whatever, but please!

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:56.460
I want to introduce Vulcan
with confidence, like Tina!

00:10:56.460 --> 00:10:58.170
Who's Tina?

00:10:57.590 --> 00:11:04.310
In the surrounding neighborhood, trees have been
slashed by what seem to be very sharp knives.

00:11:04.310 --> 00:11:07.520
The police are using all possible means to locate witnesses.

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:08.770
Kiyomaro, please!

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:11.440
Another incident in this neighborhood?

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:20.030
{Part B}

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:35.380
What was that form?

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:39.510
What was that power?

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:43.340
Help! Someone!

00:11:43.890 --> 00:11:46.220
Help the kind Koruru!

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:47.310
Sister?

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:53.560
Yesterday, you and I...
did something happen?

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:55.820
Nothing at all!

00:11:55.820 --> 00:11:58.480
Hey, why don't we go
play ball in the park?

00:11:58.480 --> 00:11:59.490
Okay.

00:12:00.610 --> 00:12:02.030
All right, let's go!

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:06.780
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:10.790
What's wrong, Kiyomaro?

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:12.790
Aren't we going to play?

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:13.790
Yeah.

00:12:14.210 --> 00:12:16.710
I really hope a demon
wasn't involved with this.

00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:21.420
Kiyomaro, I can see the park!

00:12:21.420 --> 00:12:22.380
Here!

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:25.720
Good, good!

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:26.970
That's a nice toss.

00:12:27.760 --> 00:12:29.310
All right, one more time!

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:30.270
Here!

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:32.180
As long as I don't read
from that book,

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:34.730
Koruru will remain as her kind self.

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:37.980
No! Don't read from the book!

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:42.320
Sister?

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:44.360
Sorry!

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:45.490
What's wrong?

00:12:45.490 --> 00:12:47.620
You seem out of it today.

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:50.950
So, something did happen yesterday.

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:53.540
What are you saying?
Nothing happened!

00:12:53.540 --> 00:12:55.250
Here we go, Koruru!

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:56.250
Toss!

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:00.880
Sorry, Koruru!

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:02.470
It's okay. I'll go get it!

00:13:02.470 --> 00:13:04.380
But don't throw like that
without warning me!

00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:06.640
Be careful! That's the street...

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:09.470
No way.

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:12.770
It's destiny.
You can't escape.

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:14.440
Koruru! Come back!

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:16.230
Don't you hear the horn?!

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:22.320
I have to protect her!

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:24.110
This is the only way!

00:13:24.110 --> 00:13:26.950
If I'm going to save her,
there's no other choice!

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:28.370
Zeruku!

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:31.450
Kiyomaro!
That noise just now...

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:33.910
- Let's go, Gash!
- Whoa, Kiyomaro!

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:35.920
No way... another demon?

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:41.500
Zakeru!

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:46.840
Koruru!

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:49.260
I knew it.
The culprit was a demon!

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:51.180
Zakeru!

00:13:54.810 --> 00:13:55.810
Koruru!

00:13:56.690 --> 00:13:59.150
Pain... Suffering...

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:00.440
I have to protect her.

00:14:00.440 --> 00:14:01.770
I have to protect Koruru!

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:02.780
Zeruku!

00:14:06.610 --> 00:14:07.860
She's fast!

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:09.030
Zakeru!

00:14:11.700 --> 00:14:12.740
Koruru!

00:14:13.040 --> 00:14:14.450
Gash, are you okay?

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:17.330
Koruru...

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:19.790
Don't pick on Koruru!

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:23.420
This is...

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:25.300
Koruru! A new spell!

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:27.930
Read it! Quickly!

00:14:27.930 --> 00:14:28.970
Zerusen!

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:40.270
Gash, are you okay?

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:42.980
Don't worry about me.
More importantly...

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:45.150
That girl... the book owner is...

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:48.030
Wait... it can't be...

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:49.740
Koruru's big sister?

00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:51.280
Tears?

00:14:51.780 --> 00:14:55.160
N-No, it's not just her.

00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:57.660
The demon is also...

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:03.130
Why are they both fighting and crying?

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:05.750
Gash, let's keep our distance first!

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:07.590
They're crying!

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:08.590
What?

00:15:09.430 --> 00:15:10.590
Kiyomaro,

00:15:11.140 --> 00:15:14.600
I can't fight them.

00:15:14.890 --> 00:15:16.560
Don't read any spells, please!

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:18.680
What the hell are you talking about?

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:19.850
They're going to attack!

00:15:19.850 --> 00:15:21.850
But, Kiyomaro! I...

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:23.900
Please!
Don't hurt her anymore!

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:25.440
I can...

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:27.860
Stop attacking!

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:32.530
I can see their suffering!

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:34.580
Even so, if this keeps up...

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:36.160
Let's go, Gash!

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:38.370
No! Don't read any more spells!

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:39.540
Zeruku!

00:15:40.920 --> 00:15:41.920
Gash!

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:45.130
Gash!

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:49.340
Kiyomaro... I know that
person with the book!

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:50.340
What?

00:15:50.840 --> 00:15:53.180
She makes dolls for her little sister

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:55.300
and picks her up from
the park and stuff!

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:57.560
She's a very kind big sister!

00:15:59.140 --> 00:16:02.900
To fight while crying like that...

00:16:02.900 --> 00:16:04.690
there must be a reason behind it!

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:07.480
You're Shiori-chan, right?!

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:09.990
Koruru's big sister Shiori-chan, right?!

00:16:10.690 --> 00:16:13.780
I'm Gash Bell, Koruru's friend!

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:15.370
We've stopped our attacks,

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:17.910
so stop attacking us!

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:20.040
The boy from before!

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:22.460
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:25.750
Please! Help her. Help Koruru!

00:16:26.170 --> 00:16:27.710
What? Koruru?

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:29.420
This is Koruru?

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:33.800
Koruru is a demon?

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:35.890
Stop, Koruru!

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:37.390
Stop hurting him!

00:16:37.390 --> 00:16:39.890
Shut up, you coward.

00:16:41.770 --> 00:16:44.690
They're not going to hurt you anymore!

00:16:44.690 --> 00:16:46.440
I won't let him live!

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:47.520
Koruru!

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:57.700
Koruru... I'm Shiori, remember?

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:06.630
Damn it. Why are you smiling?

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:09.170
That's right.
You're turning back to normal.

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:10.340
You're Koruru.

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:12.880
Damn it!

00:17:13.220 --> 00:17:15.800
My sweet Koruru...

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:24.770
Thank you, Gash-kun,
for stopping Koruru.

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:32.480
Huh? Gash?

00:17:33.490 --> 00:17:34.320
Why am I here?

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:36.860
Shiori!
You're hurt!

00:17:39.830 --> 00:17:40.910
This...

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:42.700
Even though I...

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:45.330
I did all this?

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:47.120
It's okay! It's over now.

00:17:47.120 --> 00:17:48.460
It's all over now!

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:51.960
Gash, burn this book.

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:53.800
W-What?!

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:56.720
If that book is burned,
you'll disappear!

00:17:56.720 --> 00:17:58.840
You'll go back to the demon world!

00:17:58.840 --> 00:18:00.600
W-What do you mean?

00:18:00.600 --> 00:18:01.850
But...

00:18:02.260 --> 00:18:04.390
my other side got out, right?

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:07.310
And everyone got hurt!

00:18:08.150 --> 00:18:10.360
I heard about how it works before.

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:14.860
My own will to fight is weak,

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:17.990
but another personality
takes over me.

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:21.330
Once the battle starts,
I can't turn back.

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:23.870
What are you talking about?
That sort of thing can't...

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:25.540
You saw it, didn't you?!

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:28.080
I hurt many people!

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:29.960
Why did you read from the book?!

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:34.630
I see. A separate personality
forces her to fight.

00:18:34.630 --> 00:18:35.880
Damn it!

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:38.260
That's...

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:41.100
I can't burn my own book, so...

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:43.640
I'm begging you.
Please, Gash.

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:48.020
No! I can't do it!

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:50.400
I know you guys don't
want to be separated!

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:51.400
But...

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:54.020
If something happens,
I'll protect you, Koruru!

00:18:54.020 --> 00:18:55.480
So, it's okay!

00:18:56.070 --> 00:18:57.700
But, Gash...

00:18:57.700 --> 00:19:00.700
I can't take it anymore!

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:05.700
That's right... this child
has to endure these fights.

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:12.000
Gash. Look closely at that girl's book.

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:15.960
What? Is there something weird on it?

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:19.470
This girl really wants to stay in this world.

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:21.590
But for everyone's sake,

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:23.720
she's desperately holding back.

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:24.890
That settles it...

00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:26.640
Zakeru.

00:19:29.640 --> 00:19:31.230
What are you doing, Kiyomaro?!

00:19:31.230 --> 00:19:33.020
Did you trick me?!

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:34.520
I had to do it!

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:37.070
Damn. Damn!

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:39.950
Just when we finally met
a friendly demon...

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:44.320
Thank you. Thank you, kind bro!

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:47.870
Gash, it's better this way.

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:49.370
Koruru...

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:52.370
Koruru... don't leave!

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:54.710
I'll be all alone again.

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:56.840
I'm sorry, Sis Shiori.

00:19:57.210 --> 00:20:00.970
But, you're not alone! 
I'll always be with you!

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:05.890
Try talking to your family
about your loneliness.

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:08.470
Koruru!

00:20:08.470 --> 00:20:11.730
I'll always watch over you!

00:20:12.230 --> 00:20:16.060
Because you're truly my kind older sister!

00:20:17.780 --> 00:20:18.780
Koruru...

00:20:19.740 --> 00:20:20.780
Koruru...

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:24.200
Gash... and everyone, thank you.

00:20:25.410 --> 00:20:28.240
If you become the kind
ruler of the demon world,

00:20:28.740 --> 00:20:32.160
maybe we won't need to
fight like this anymore.

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:35.750
A kind ruler...

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:38.920
Yeah... just like you said.

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:44.590
I'll do it, Koruru. I will make it to the
end of this battle, no matter what.

00:20:44.890 --> 00:20:47.640
Then, I'll become a kind ruler!

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:51.310
Please, Gash!

00:20:53.940 --> 00:20:55.730
Koruru! Koruru!

00:20:57.980 --> 00:21:03.820
I'll... I'll become a kind ruler!

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:05.160
{Ending}

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:20.880
ne konna koto tsuzukete itemo

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:20.880
You know, even if we continue to progress like this

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:26.090
shiawase wa mitsukaru no kana?

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:26.090
Will we be able to find true happiness?

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:31.180
tarinai mono kazoete mitemo

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:31.180
When I try counting what is missing in my life

00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:36.350
kiri ga nai no wakatteru you

00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:36.350
I know the list will keep going on and on

00:21:36.850 --> 00:21:42.030
shinario douri nante

00:21:36.850 --> 00:21:42.030
Everything goes according to plans

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:46.740
umaku iku wake nai kara

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:46.740
Of course that can never happen

00:21:47.160 --> 00:21:49.410
toki ni wa zenbu

00:21:47.160 --> 00:21:49.410
At times, everything that I have

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:52.240
nagedashi taku naru

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:52.240
I just want to let it all go

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:58.040
sonna hi ga attemo iiyone

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:58.040
Is it uncommon to have days like this?

00:22:00.670 --> 00:22:05.590
hito wa mina okubyou dakara

00:22:00.670 --> 00:22:05.590
Everyone is afraid, even though we don't show it

00:22:05.800 --> 00:22:10.100
yume wo miru no kana?

00:22:05.800 --> 00:22:10.100
Is that why we dream?

00:22:11.010 --> 00:22:15.930
hito wa mina kodoku dakara

00:22:11.010 --> 00:22:15.930
Everyone feels lonely on the inside

00:22:16.180 --> 00:22:20.480
ai wo sagasu no kana?

00:22:16.180 --> 00:22:20.480
Is that why we look for love?

00:22:20.940 --> 00:22:23.480
kitto chigau

00:22:20.940 --> 00:22:23.480
Even though you are not here

00:22:23.610 --> 00:22:25.900
basho de kimi mo

00:22:23.610 --> 00:22:25.900
know that where ever you are

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:28.070
onaji tsuki wo

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:28.070
You are gazing up

00:22:28.280 --> 00:22:31.740
miteru you ne...

00:22:28.280 --> 00:22:31.740
at the same moon as me...

00:22:35.120 --> 00:22:35.160
{Preview}

00:22:38.120 --> 00:22:41.590
It's great, Gash! We can
read a new spell now!

00:22:41.590 --> 00:22:46.090
Kiyomaro, will that spell
make me a little stronger?

00:22:46.090 --> 00:22:47.720
Yes! Definitely!

00:22:47.720 --> 00:22:49.640
Reveal the new spell!

00:22:49.640 --> 00:22:52.300
This enemy... when did
he move behind us?

00:22:52.300 --> 00:22:54.430
"Zakeru" and "Rashirudo"
have no effect on him!

00:22:54.430 --> 00:22:58.390
Next time, on Konjiki no Gash Bell:
The Third Spell, Jikerudo!

00:22:58.770 --> 00:23:02.150
There's no way I'm letting
this guy become the ruler!

00:23:02.150 --> 00:23:05.110
The Third Spell, Jikerudo
